# The repository is LF-only: every text file is stored with LF and checked
# out with LF on every platform. This overrides Git for Windows' default
# core.autocrlf=true, whose CRLF working trees break byte-comparing checks
# (pnpm skills:check) and dirty generated files (pnpm sdk-codegen).
# Binary files are untouched: text=auto applies only to files git detects
# as text. Encoding is enforced separately (UTF-8 without BOM) by
# pnpm encoding:check.
* text=auto eol=lf
